menu "Companion link (knob)"

    config COMPANION_TOKEN
        int "Shared token byte (must match the clock's COMPANION_TOKEN)"
        range 0 255
        default 0
        help
            Same LAN-trusted posture as the clock side: 0 on either end
            means "accept any". Set both sides to the same non-zero byte
            to keep a curious neighbour off the dial.

    config COMPANION_PORT
        int "Clock UDP listen port"
        range 1024 65535
        default 50188
        help
            The clock's companion listener port (components/companion).
            Discovery runs over mDNS (_moonclock._udp.local); this port
            is the fallback datagram target (broadcast) while unknown.

endmenu
